 245:../src/FreeRTOS/queue.c ****  * priority, but the waiting task times out, then the holder should
 246:../src/FreeRTOS/queue.c ****  * disinherit the priority - but only down to the highest priority of any
 247:../src/FreeRTOS/queue.c ****  * other tasks that are waiting for the same mutex.  This function returns
 248:../src/FreeRTOS/queue.c ****  * that priority.
 249:../src/FreeRTOS/queue.c ****  */
 250:../src/FreeRTOS/queue.c ****     static UBaseType_t prvGetHighestPriorityOfWaitToReceiveList( const Queue_t * const pxQueue ) PR
